Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.28,0:13:56.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再见 哲明{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}See you, Jimmy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.86,0:14:15.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 妈妈  - 你好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hi, Mom.  - Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.37,0:14:54.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别那样 停手 停手 雅历{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't do it! No! Stop... Stop it, Alex!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.20,0:15:21.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,OCP界认定你为一副...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}OCP defines you as a machine...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.27,0:15:26.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,使用活组织的机器 你要明白这一点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...that utilizes some living tissue. You understand that.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.24,0:15:28.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.91,0:15:34.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是否认为自己是... 人类{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And so do you consider yourself human?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.21,0:15:38.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要一个答案{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I require an answer.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.45,0:15:42.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,停止录影{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stop tape.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.25,0:15:47.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你可知道你对那女人做了什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have any idea what you're doing to that poor woman?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.76,0:15:50.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看看她的档案{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take a look at her file.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.69,0:15:52.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go on.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.46,0:15:57.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,探员 麦太太... 正在控告OCP{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Officer, Mrs. Murphy is bringing suit against OCP.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.50,0:16:00.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我叫狄汤姆 我代表她的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My name is Tom Delaney. I'm representing her.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.24,0:16:03.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,几个月前 她还是不肯离开她的卧房{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Up to a few months ago, she wouldn't leave her bedroom.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.64,0:16:06.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,后来接受了催眠和协调治疗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then there were hypnotists and harmonic treatments.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.64,0:16:10.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然后你就耍花样 每天开车经过她的家{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then you pull this shit! Driving past her house day after day.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.75,0:16:14.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,监视她 尝试令她以为丈夫仍在世{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Spying on her. Trying to make her think her husband is still alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.45,0:16:17.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她稍为开始接受丧夫之痛{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's barely started to accept the loss.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.52,0:16:20.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你又来刺激她  - 为什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You're ripping her to pieces.  - And for what?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.49,0:16:24.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你以为可以再做她丈夫吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you think you could ever be a husband to her?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.36,0:16:27.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你可以给她什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean, what can you offer her?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.30,0:16:30.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,伴侣关系{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Companionship?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.27,0:16:33.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,爱情{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Love?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.74,0:16:36.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一个男人的爱{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A man's love?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.46,0:16:53.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.56,0:16:57.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,继续录影{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Roll tape.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.10,0:17:03.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是不是雅历{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you Alex Murphy?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.34,0:17:07.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.97,0:17:09.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是不是人类{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you human?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.47,0:17:11.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.44,0:17:14.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你只是一副机器{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You are simply a machine.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.28,0:17:18.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.88,0:17:20.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一副机器{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...a machine.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.68,0:17:22.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只是一副机器{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nothing more.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.02,0:17:24.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只是一副机器{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nothing more.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.63,0:17:30.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可以了 停止录影{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That'll do it. Stop tape.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.23,0:17:37.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你留下来 带她进来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, you stay there. All right, go get her.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.74,0:17:40.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们有道德一点吧 给他们一些私隐{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's be decent about this. Give them some privacy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.61,0:17:43.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有问题{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't have a problem with that.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.96,0:18:39.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,雅历{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Alex?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.06,0:18:42.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不认识我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't you know me?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.74,0:18:47.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不记得我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't you remember me?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.27,0:18:53.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们对你做了什么也不要紧的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Alex, it doesn't matter what they've done to you...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.91,0:18:56.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,触摸我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Touch me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.22,0:19:07.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是冷的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.13,0:19:10.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们制造了这个...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They made this...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.46,0:19:12.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来向我致敬{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...to honor him.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.13,0:19:19.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 不 我...  - 你的丈夫死了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- No, I...  - Your husband is dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.57,0:19:24.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不认识你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.50,0:19:53.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为何会这样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why is this happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.05,0:20:13.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我以为所有通讯系统都是一样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I thought all communication systems were the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.92,0:20:16.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想替公司省点钱{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I tried to save the company a few bucks.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.33,0:20:21.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,花了两天才从克利夫兰下载到规格{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It took two days to download specs from Cleveland.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.33,0:20:25.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我失去了那个客户{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I lost the account.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.91,0:20:31.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,（OCP通讯）{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.91,0:20:34.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,（唯一的选择）{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.33,0:20:52.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,强生 要我来见你真是有损我的尊严{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It hardly befits my dignity to have to come to you, Johnson.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.60,0:20:55.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,市长 抱歉这个轻微的不便之处{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sorry for the slight inconvenience, Your Honor.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.40,0:20:57.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,繁忙时间里的20分钟不算轻微{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Twenty minutes in rush hour isn't slight.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.83,0:20:59.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当你是底特律市长时就不算轻微{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not when you're mayor of a major city!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.04,0:21:03.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们何时会发薪给那些警察 让他们恢复执勤{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When will you start paying the cops so they'll go back to work?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.84,0:21:05.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们不是慈善机构{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're not a charity.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.78,0:21:07.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,市政府欠我们三千七百多万元{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The city owes us over $37 million.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.18,0:21:11.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你要宽限我们一点  - 限期就是限期{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You'll have to cut us some slack.  - A deadline's a deadline. Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.85,0:21:14.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们怎么筹得到那笔钱{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How are we supposed to raise that kind of money?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.48,0:21:16.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们不用筹{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You aren't.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.82,0:21:20.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 他说什么  - 我们不预期你们付钱{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What the hell is he talking about?  - We don't expect you to pay.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.46,0:21:22.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让我给你引述我们的合约{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let me refer you to our contract.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.56,0:21:26.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,"出现违约情况时..."{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"In the event of default...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.23,0:21:30.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,"OCP将有绝对权利没收所有市内的资产"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...OCP shall have the uncontested right of foreclosure on all city assets."
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.47,0:21:34.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你签了这个的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You signed this.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.34,0:21:37.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们欠一次付款 你就可以取消赎回权{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We miss one payment, and you can foreclose?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.14,0:21:39.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们可以也会实行{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We can and we will.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.31,0:21:42.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们要把底特律私有化{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're taking Detroit private.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.75,0:21:45.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你故意损害我们的信誉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So you deliberately undermined our credit.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.48,0:21:47.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是容易办的事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That was the easy part.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.52,0:21:50.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们还策划警员罢工{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you engineered the police strike.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.12,0:21:53.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们想底特律陷入困境{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You want Detroit to tear itself apart...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.49,0:21:56.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让你们可把它像间公司般吞并{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...so you can raid it like you would any other corporation!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.63,0:21:58.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们可知道会有多少人命危{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you know how many people are dying?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.90,0:22:01.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你们是杀人凶手  - 不要再说{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You're murderers!  - I'd advise you to say nothing further.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.47,0:22:03.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这可能会...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It might be...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.37,0:22:04.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,引致诉讼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...actionable.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.77,0:22:06.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,胡说{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's bullshit!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.77,0:22:09.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 胡说 你这个老混蛋  - 冷静点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Bullshit, you senile, old bastard!  - All right, calm down.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.87,0:22:11.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我们还是走吧  - 我没事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- We better get out of here.  - I'm okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.14,0:22:14.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我们走吧  - 我很冷静{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Calm down. We better leave.  - I'm calm.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.41,0:22:16.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 冷静 放松点  - 我没事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Calm down. Easy.  - I'm okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.71,0:22:18.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, good.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.18,0:22:21.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我很自制 没有事  - 一切都好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I'm in control. Everything is fine. It's okay.  - Relax.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.69,0:22:23.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我很好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.49,0:22:25.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,各位 还有一件事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One last thing, gentlemen.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.62,0:22:27.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们会控告你们的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We will sue your asses.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.46,0:22:29.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,尽管做吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Give it your best shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.49,0:22:33.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去你的 老头混蛋 简直胡说八道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fuck you, you old, senile bastard! This is bullshit!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.40,0:22:34.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去你的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fuck you!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.20,0:22:37.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 简直混帐  - 冷静点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- This is bullshit!  - Calm down.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.71,0:22:45.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,强生 我已很有耐性 五个月了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've been very patient, Johnson. Five months.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.48,0:22:48.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 她是谁  - 茱莉·费博士{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Who's that?  - That's Dr. Juliette Faxx.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.61,0:22:51.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,提升了做态度校正组主管{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just moved up to head the Attitude Adjustment team.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.35,0:22:55.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,五个月 九千万元{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Five months. Ninety million dollars!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.19,0:23:01.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我要看到一些成绩  - 我会给你看看的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I want to see some results.  - Yes, sir. I'll show you what we have.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.96,0:23:05.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,OCP领导半机械人研制科技{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}OCP pioneered cyborg technology.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.80,0:23:08.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在我们跨进了一大步{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And now we take a quantum leap forward.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.63,0:23:10.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,结合软体和有机体系统作操控的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}State-of-the-art destructive capabilities...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.07,0:23:15.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,最新型的攻击装置{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...commanded by a unique combination of software and organic systems.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.94,0:23:18.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是原装版本的一大改良{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In every way, an improvement over the original.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.78,0:23:23.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我很荣幸为大家介绍... 机械警察二号{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It gives me great pleasure to introduce to you, Robocop 2.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.02,0:23:36.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你被拘捕了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You are under arrest.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.40,0:23:40.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,停止 否则我会开枪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stop or I'll shoot.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.67,0:23:44.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,停止 否则我会开枪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stop or I'll shoot.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.01,0:23:57.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,OCP很荣幸介绍 未来的市区保安装备{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}OCP is proud to present the future of urban pacification:
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.38,0:23:59.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,机械警察二号{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Robocop 2.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.53,0:24:19.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,九千万{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ninety million.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.17,0:24:24.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它们都是疯的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They all go crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.24,0:24:26.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有情绪问题的机械人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Robots with emotional problems.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.78,0:24:29.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是机械人 是半机械人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, sir, not robots, cyborgs.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.41,0:24:33.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,机械装置生物体 我们利用活人组织那是问题所在{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cybernetic organisms. We use living human tissue and that's our whole problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.82,0:24:36.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,被挑选的都是受人尊敬的警察{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The candidates were all fine men, respected police officers.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.05,0:24:39.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我亲自看过他们的档案{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I reviewed their files myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.22,0:24:43.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,老板 警察可能不是我们的最佳人选{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sir, police officers may not be the best candidates for our purposes.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.79,0:24:46.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们只是精壮和雄纠纠的一群{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're a physical bunch. They're macho, body-proud.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.60,0:24:50.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,除去这部分 他们就变得有自杀倾向{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stripped of all that it's no wonder they become suicidal.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.27,0:24:52.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们唯一成功的是个警察{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Our one success was a cop.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.64,0:24:55.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对 亚历克斯·墨菲{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, yes, Mr. Johnson. Alex Murphy.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.27,0:24:58.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,同辈中的精英 虔诚的爱尔兰籍天主教徒住家男人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Top of his class, devout Irish Catholic, family man.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.41,0:25:01.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,显示他有强烈的责任感{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everything in his profile indicates a fierce sense of duty.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.71,0:25:03.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是维持他生存的要素{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's probably what kept him alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.71,0:25:07.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,恕我直言 你的专长是心理学{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}With due respect, Dr. Faxx, your area of expertise is psychology.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.65,0:25:08.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是机械人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not robotics.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.19,0:25:12.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不妨听听她说 对不对{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's no harm in hearing the young lady out, is there?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.42,0:25:13.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.82,0:25:17.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢 我相信亚历克斯·墨菲的情况是不寻常但并非罕见{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you, sir. I believe that Murphy's case was unusual but not unique.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.99,0:25:22.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们可另觅人选 一个甚至让前景变得...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We can find someone else, someone to whom the prospect might even be...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.63,0:25:23.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,合意的人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...desirable.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.54,0:25:28.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我从没见过有人想做机械人的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've never met anyone who wanted to be a robot.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.64,0:25:32.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要经过筛选 我乐意负责监督{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It would require a screening process, one I'd would be happy to supervise.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.64,0:25:34.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,成本可能是很少{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The cost would be negligible.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.98,0:25:38.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,浪费那方面的工作会很可惜{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It would be a shame to waste all the work that's been done.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.12,0:25:40.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当然是的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It certainly would.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.15,0:25:43.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,进行吧 直接向我报告{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go to it. Report to me directly.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.99,0:25:45.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,知道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.89,0:25:49.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你可以从她身上学到一点东西{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You could learn a thing or two from that girl, Johnson.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.46,0:25:56.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我可不会{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}not for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.63,0:26:00.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,给良好警察 良好待遇{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Decent pay to decent cops!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.21,0:26:08.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,工会有一张名单 我们不会放过你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Union's got a list! We ain't forgetting who you are!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.05,0:26:10.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,逐个说{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One at a time!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.68,0:26:16.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,麻烦你 逐个说{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please, one at a time.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.82,0:26:22.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们不知道这里的情况吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't you know what's going on out here?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.96,0:26:26.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们已经尽了力{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's the best we can do!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.10,0:26:29.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小姐们 你好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hello, ladies!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.47,0:26:36.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们不能再袭击警察{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They won't be fucking with any more cops!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.01,0:26:39.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们不能再惹任何人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They won't be fucking with nobody, man!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.51,0:27:16.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(重播)
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.91,0:27:20.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,何博 就是他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hob. That's him.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.32,0:27:23.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.86,0:27:29.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,给我核灵{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nuke me!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.36,0:27:35.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来吧 拿两支{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go ahead. Take two.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.30,0:27:38.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有很多货{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's plenty of Nuke to go around.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.10,0:27:41.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他走丢了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've lost him.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.81,0:27:43.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你很久没有来了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You haven't been around in a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.74,0:27:45.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我请客{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go ahead. This one's on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.11,0:27:48.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,西南偏南五度{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Five degrees south-southwest.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.05,0:27:50.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,找到那个小子了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's the little darling.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.18,0:27:52.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,眼睛很锐利呢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good eyes, Murphy.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.62,0:27:54.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,锐利得很{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good as money can buy.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.88,0:27:56.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,费迪 你出 来了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ferdy, you got out.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.15,0:27:59.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我会告诉勒恩{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, I'll tell Cain, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.27,0:28:11.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这次最好给我一点情报{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Better have something to give me this time, officer.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.67,0:28:18.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,每辆车有一个警察 这些是路线{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One cop per car. Okay, these are the routes.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.04,0:28:21.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有三辆车{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Three cars.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.21,0:28:22.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 每辆车有一个警察  - 对{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- One cop per car?  - That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.18,0:28:27.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,作为射击目标 我们安排了三个狙击手{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sitting ducks. We set up three snipers and that's all it takes.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.85,0:28:31.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 付钱给他  - 好的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Pay the man.  - All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.55,0:28:32.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.99,0:28:35.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你没有点算  - 不用了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You didn't count it.  - That's all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.29,0:28:37.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你该点算一下{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You should really count it, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.49,0:28:38.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不用了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.03,0:28:42.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,给他一点东西 减轻他良心的悔疚吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Give him something to help him with his conscience.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.30,0:28:47.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不用了 我不要它{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, that's all right. I don't really want it.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.84,0:28:50.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来吧 杜飞 我知道你需要它{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, Duffy. I know you need it.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.43,0:29:11.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今天不是要上学吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Isn't this a school day?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.67,0:29:18.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,警察{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cops!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.04,0:29:22.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,该死{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.78,0:29:31.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不好了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.33,0:29:51.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别动{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Freeze!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.54,0:29:55.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,转过身来 举高双手{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Turn around. Put your hands up.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.72,0:30:11.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,该死{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.10,0:30:28.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,杜飞探员 请坐{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Officer Duffy, have a seat.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.11,0:30:37.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,婊子 你好像没气了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You look a little out of breath, bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.68,0:30:45.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 杜飞探员 你出卖我们  - 什么意思{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You sold us out, Officer Duffy.  - What are you talking about, Murph?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.82,0:30:48.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,勒恩在哪里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where is Cain?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.69,0:30:51.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不认识什么勒恩{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know any Cain.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.50,0:30:55.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,勒恩在哪里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where is Cain?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.80,0:30:58.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不知道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.21,0:31:07.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,勒恩在哪里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where is Cain?!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.78,0:31:10.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我说过我不知道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I told you, I don't know!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.77,0:31:35.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在哪里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.94,0:31:38.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在鲁兹河那间旧矿泥工厂{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}River Rouge. The old sludge plant.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.78,0:31:42.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是个腐败的警察{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're a rotten cop.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.65,0:32:52.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,（私家重地 闲人免进）{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.35,0:34:35.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.52,0:35:50.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你  - 你要我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You.  - You want me?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:50.46,0:35:52.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不管死活{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dead or alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.06,0:35:55.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们其中一个要死了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then one of us must die.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:56.23,0:35:57.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么死吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dead, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:21.62,0:36:23.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天啊...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jesus...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.56,0:36:25.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,竟有这样的日子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...had days like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:26.86,0:36:29.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,像个罪犯般被追捕和袭击{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hounded and attacked like a criminal.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.00,0:36:32.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但像他一样 我不怪责你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But like him, I don't blame you.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.14,0:36:35.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们给你输入程式 你照着做{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They program you, and you do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:36.37,0:36:41.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我会杀了你  - 试试吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I will kill you.  - Oh, you just tried.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:42.48,0:36:43.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而且...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.15,0:36:45.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我原谅你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...I forgive you.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:58.15,0:38:00.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,干嘛停手 你把它砸开{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why'd you stop? You got it cracked.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:00.19,0:38:01.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我很累{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm tired.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:01.96,0:38:04.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们说他有脑袋 我要看{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They say he's got a brain. I want to see it.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.23,0:38:12.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你以为是我打你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You think it was me that beat you?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:13.04,0:38:14.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It wasn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:15.47,0:38:16.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是这个{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was this.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.09,0:38:34.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它太硬了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's too tough.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:35.36,0:38:37.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在关节位置试试{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Try here at the joint.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:43.43,0:38:44.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.14,0:38:50.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look at that!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:00.42,0:39:02.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来吧 凿开它{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on. Cut it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:05.39,0:39:07.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,滋味怎样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How's it taste?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.77,0:39:21.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到底什么事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the hell's going on?!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:22.27,0:39:24.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天 看他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Man, just look at him.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.34,0:39:28.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他被拆开了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Christ, he's been stripped.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.12,0:39:44.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们别感情用事 它只是一件机器{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's not get carried away here. We're talking about a piece of equipment.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:45.13,0:39:47.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别告诉我他不能受苦{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't tell me he can't suffer.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:47.93,0:39:49.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看看他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just look at him.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:50.13,0:39:52.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是电力作用{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's electrical.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:52.57,0:39:54.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,胡说{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bullshit.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.60,0:39:57.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我清楚他的每一英吋 每条电路{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know every inch of him. Every circuit.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.57,0:39:59.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,每条活神经{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Every living nerve.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:59.71,0:40:03.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他的痛楚中枢是活的 活跃得像亮了灯的圣诞树{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}His pain centers are alive. They're lit up like Christmas trees.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:03.85,0:40:06.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,后备发电机令他抽搐{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The back-up generator's just making him twitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:06.92,0:40:08.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他很痛苦{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's suffering.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.15,0:40:10.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他可以熬多久{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How long can he last?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:10.69,0:40:12.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没法知道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No way of knowing.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:12.86,0:40:15.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是最低度的维持生命装置{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Got him on minimal life support.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:16.36,0:40:19.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,靠微震维持脑部功能{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Keeping the brain going with microshocks.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:20.90,0:40:25.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 很棘手 他随时会死亡  - 走 快走{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It's damn tricky. He could go anytime.  - Move. Move!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:26.94,0:40:28.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里发生什么事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's happening in here?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:28.54,0:40:33.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,OCP的事 OCP的混蛋们一点也不肯帮他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}OCP is happening. These bastards won't lift a finger to help him.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:33.21,0:40:36.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个单位需要数百万元的零件{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This unit needs millions of dollars in parts.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:36.25,0:40:40.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不能一夜间批核那笔费用 请讲讲道理{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can't expect authorization for that kind of cash overnight. Be reasonable.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:40.45,0:40:42.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,若你不修理他 就是谋杀{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you don't fix him, it's murder.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:42.38,0:40:45.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,冷静点 我跟你谈是给你恩惠了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Settle down. I'm doing you a favor by talking to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:45.79,0:40:48.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你这个混蛋 他很痛苦{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You son of a bitch. He's in hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:52.26,0:40:53.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,修理他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fix him!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:55.06,0:40:56.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们会保持联络{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We'll be in touch.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:04.57,0:41:06.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们是最了不起的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, man, you guys are the greatest!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:07.14,0:41:09.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你可看到他们的脸{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did you see their faces?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:09.28,0:41:12.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,"我们会抛掉那锁匙 杜飞"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"We're gonna throw away the key, Duffy."
Dialogue: 0,0:41:14.32,0:41:16.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,警方可有给你麻烦{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The cops didn't give you trouble, did they?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:16.79,0:41:20.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,李约翰惯常的废话 他们证明不到什么的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The usual shit from Reed. They'll never prove anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:21.02,0:41:22.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喝一点吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, want some?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:22.49,0:41:25.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是个小孩 我不想犯法{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, I'm a minor. Don't want to break any laws.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:26.93,0:41:28.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你拿着吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here, you take it.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:28.66,0:41:30.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我真喜欢你们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}God, I just love you guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:35.64,0:41:37.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:37.94,0:41:39.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们去哪里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, where we going?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:40.04,0:41:43.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别这样 这样不好玩{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, come on, guys. This isn't funny, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:43.28,0:41:44.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天啊 我的头{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, God, my head.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:45.35,0:41:48.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的头很痛{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My head is killing me.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:49.52,0:41:51.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,老兄 到底...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, man. What's...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:51.49,0:41:54.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,勒恩 看到你真好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, Cain! Hey, it's good to see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:55.16,0:41:56.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢你救我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thanks for getting me out.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:58.46,0:42:00.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我不能起来  - 我们知道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I can't get up.  - You noticed that one.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:01.03,0:42:04.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我不知道那个孩子对你说什么  - 你告诉他们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Cain, I don't know what the kid told you...  - You told them, Duffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:04.73,0:42:07.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你告诉他们我们在哪里  - 没有{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You told them where we were.  - That's not true.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:07.24,0:42:12.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我们全都知道  - 你以为我们只有你一个警察{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- We know all about it, Duffy.  - You think you're the only cop we have?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:14.64,0:42:16.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,该死{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:16.75,0:42:19.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,勒恩 求求你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cain. Cain, come on. Man, I'm begging you, man!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:19.25,0:42:21.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我什么也愿意做{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, I'll do anything!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:21.95,0:42:24.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你说笑吧 对 你在说笑{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay. You're kidding, right? Yeah, you're just kidding.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:25.19,0:42:29.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你吓怕我了 你给了我一个教训{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You scared me. You taught me a lesson, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:29.23,0:42:32.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不会耍你们 因为我很喜欢你们的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'd never fuck with you, because I really love you guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:32.60,0:42:34.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 真的  - 闭嘴{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I really do!  - Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:34.80,0:42:39.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我一直很忠心 我还有一些内幕消息没告诉你们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've been loyal. I know shit that I still haven't even told you, Cain!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:40.64,0:42:43.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是罪有应得的 勒恩差点没命{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You deserve this, Duffy. Cain might have been killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:43.74,0:42:45.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:45.34,0:42:47.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你应该叫那个孩子离开{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe you ought to have the kid leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:48.81,0:42:52.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 为什么  - 叫那个孩子离开是什么意思{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Why?  - What do you mean, "have the kid leave"?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:53.22,0:42:57.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真有特色"叫那个孩子离开"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's a good touch. That's a good touch."Have the kid leave."
Dialogue: 0,0:42:59.29,0:43:01.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,"叫那个孩子离开" 为什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's good."Have the kid leave." Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:03.53,0:43:06.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别这样 闹完了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on. It's over.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:06.53,0:43:09.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,勒恩 别这样 你做什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, Cain! Come on, man. What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:11.43,0:43:12.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别这样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:27.85,0:43:30.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你说你只会吓他一下{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You said you were just gonna scare him!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:30.82,0:43:32.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他不是很害怕吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Doesn't he look scared?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:43.47,0:43:45.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,难以置信你竟然这样做{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't believe you'd do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:45.47,0:43:48.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,申先生 你相信什么都不要紧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It hardly matters what you believe, Mr. Schenk.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:48.60,0:43:51.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但这些是罪犯 他们是狂人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But these are criminals. They're maniacs.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:51.57,0:43:54.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你太早作判断了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're giving premature value judgments.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:55.95,0:43:59.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不错 这些人可能是误入歧途{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, it may be true. The subjects are socially misaligned.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:59.58,0:44:02.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,误入歧途 这些都是死囚{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Socially misaligned? These are death row inmates!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:02.69,0:44:06.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而且对社会毫无用处 我们要找一个...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And of no use to society. We need a subject who'll welcome the power...
Dialogue: 0,0:44:06.46,0:44:08.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,愿意接受力量以及永生的人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...the virtual immortality we offer.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:08.52,0:44:12.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我相信这里是寻找合适者的好地方{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, I really think this is a good place to start looking.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:13.96,0:44:18.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你是疯的  - 这是否你的专业意见{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You're out of your mind.  - Is that your professional opinion?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:18.73,0:44:21.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的 不错{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, goddamn it, it is! Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:21.34,0:44:25.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不能用我的实验室 把那样的脑袋放进我的半机械人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you are not using my lab to put that kind of a brain into my cyborg.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:25.88,0:44:27.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们会很怀念你的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We'd dearly miss you here.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:29.91,0:44:32.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你才会失业{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're the one that's gonna be out of a job.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:33.18,0:44:35.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我会直接找强生说这件事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm going to take this directly to Johnson.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:37.05,0:44:40.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他正等待着藉口要把你开除{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's just been waiting for an excuse to get you fired.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:48.93,0:44:50.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,老板早{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good morning, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:51.50,0:44:53.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉这么早打扰你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry to bother you this early.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:55.34,0:44:56.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你看来很不安{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You seem agitated.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:56.87,0:44:59.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,坦白说 我很震惊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Frankly, I'm shocked.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:59.58,0:45:01.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,申先生刚打电话来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Schenk just called.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:01.34,0:45:04.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,费博士已经开始筛选做机械警察二号计划的人选{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dr. Faxx has begun screening candidates for the Robocop 2 project...
Dialogue: 0,0:45:05.18,0:45:08.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也知道 很令人兴奋呢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So I understand. It's very exciting.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:09.08,0:45:12.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他在挑选一些神经病 杀人凶手{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's screening psychotics, sir. Murderers.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:12.22,0:45:15.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们不是计划制造一件玩具{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We aren't planning to build a toy, Johnson.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:15.26,0:45:16.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,费知道她自己在做什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Faxx knows what she's doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:16.89,0:45:20.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她要机械警察停止活动 那是个公关大灾难{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's keeping Robocop offline. It's a public-relations disaster.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:21.20,0:45:24.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要为大局着想 那个取消赎回权...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You've got to learn to look at the larger picture. The foreclosure.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:24.87,0:45:26.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对我们很重要的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You must know how important that is to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:27.14,0:45:30.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,机械警察停止执勤 外面的混乱会升级{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}With Robocop out of commission, the chaos down there will increase...
Dialogue: 0,0:45:31.21,0:45:33.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,本市就有机会落在我们手上{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...and the odds the city will fall into our hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:34.04,0:45:38.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但一个胜任的行政人员就能解决公司的形象问题{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But a competent executive would find a way to deal with the corporate image problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:38.85,0:45:41.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我非常同意 强生先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Couldn't agree with you more, Mr. Johnson.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:42.65,0:45:44.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,幸好我已经找到方法{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fortunately, I have found a way.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:44.82,0:45:48.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对 我和费小姐已经讨论过了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, Ms. Faxx and I have already discussed it.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:49.56,0:45:53.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道你会协助执行她的构思{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know you'll help to implement her ideas.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:53.56,0:45:55.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当然 我会尽力{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Of course, sir. Whatever I can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:55.43,0:45:56.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还有什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Anything else?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:57.13,0:45:59.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 要咖啡吗  - 不 谢谢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Coffee?  - No, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:00.17,0:46:02.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,出去时别忘了穿回鞋子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't forget your shoes on the way out.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:35.94,0:46:38.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他是我的病人而且垂危 我要陪着他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's my patient and critical. I must stay with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:38.64,0:46:40.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们有需要时会找你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We'll let you know when we need you.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:40.64,0:46:43.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有人比我更认识他 你们需要我的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nobody on your staff has my experience with him. You need me.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:43.91,0:46:45.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们不需要任何人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We don't need anybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:45.58,0:46:48.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谁是"我们" 你是个无知的律师{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"We". Who the hell are "we"? You're a lawyer who knows nothing!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:49.02,0:46:51.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你快要被开除了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're exactly this far from getting fired, babe.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:52.39,0:46:54.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,蔡斯达{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shyster!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:55.29,0:46:56.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他是我的人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's one of mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:57.66,0:46:59.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要他复原过来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want him back on his feet.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:00.23,0:47:03.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可能会吧 或者我们会把零件作废料出售{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe he will be, or maybe we'll just sell the parts for scrap.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:03.67,0:47:05.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要视乎我们了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's up to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:05.50,0:47:07.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,机械警察过了保用期了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You see, Robocop's off warranty.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:11.67,0:47:13.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,机械警察的指令程式...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Robocop's command program...
Dialogue: 0,0:47:13.48,0:47:16.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他的一套指示...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...his set of directives...
Dialogue: 0,0:47:17.05,0:47:21.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,决定他的行为 是时候更新那套程式了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It determines his behavior. It's time to update the program...
Dialogue: 0,0:47:21.48,0:47:25.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想听听各位的意见{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...and I would like to hear from each one of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:26.56,0:47:28.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是时候他们咨询我们了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's about time they asked us.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:28.69,0:47:31.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们收到很多家长团体的反对{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're getting a lot of heat from parents' groups.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:31.89,0:47:34.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不怪责他们 我也是个家长{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Personally, I don't blame them. I'm a parent.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:34.66,0:47:36.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那些破坏性的行为{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All that destructive behavior.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:37.03,0:47:39.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他成了我们孩子的榜样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's become a role model for our children.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:39.84,0:47:42.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我们在教他们什么  - 说得有理{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Now, what are we teaching them?  - You have a point.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:42.61,0:47:45.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果他可以说道理而不随便开枪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If he talked things out with people instead of firing that gun.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:46.54,0:47:49.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他可否花点时间应付环保问题{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Couldn't he take a little time to address environmental issues?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:50.01,0:47:51.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:51.25,0:47:53.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他可以发表环保上的意见{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He could speak out on environmental issues.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:53.82,0:47:55.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可以的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't see any reason why not.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:55.52,0:47:57.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他除了开枪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For all the shooting he does...
Dialogue: 0,0:47:57.25,0:48:00.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我从没看过他做点好事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've never once seen him take the time to do anything nice...
Dialogue: 0,0:48:01.29,0:48:05.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 譬如探访孤儿院  - 你说得对{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- like visit an orphanage.  - You're absolutely right.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:05.29,0:48:06.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,或者在树上拯救猫儿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Or help a cat out of a tree...
Dialogue: 0,0:48:07.00,0:48:09.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,或替红十字会收集捐款{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}or go door to door collecting for the Red Cross...
Dialogue: 0,0:48:09.87,0:48:14.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,或者跟童子军一起烧棉花糖{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...or maybe even roasting some marshmallows with some Cub Scouts.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:14.74,0:48:21.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,强生先生 那主意不错 谢谢你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why, Mr. Johnson, that is wonderful. Thank you so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:25.43,0:48:28.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 程式还没输入  - 他在抗拒{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It's no good. The program isn't uploading.  - He's resisting.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:28.64,0:48:29.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太多资料了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's too much data.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:30.04,0:48:34.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 不 是他 让我来吧  - 我不可以 不行的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- No, it's him. Leave him to me, Schenk.  - I can't... It's not going to work!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:35.68,0:48:37.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在浪费宝贵时间{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're wasting valuable time.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:37.74,0:48:40.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 不要抗拒我们  - 让我起来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Don't resist us.  - Let me up.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:41.08,0:48:42.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我一定要去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I must go.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:44.72,0:48:46.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去哪里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go where?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:47.15,0:48:51.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,做什么 跳舞 谈恋爱 你以为自己是什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do what? Go dancing? Fall in love? What is it you think you are?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:52.33,0:48:53.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,亚历克斯·墨菲{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Alex Murphy.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:55.63,0:48:56.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是个错觉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's a delusion.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:57.43,0:49:01.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是你系统里的故障 亚历克斯·墨菲已经死了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a glitch in your system. Alex Murphy is dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:01.37,0:49:04.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拿掉那些金属和电线 你只是桌上的一堆东西{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take away the metal and wires, you're just a couple chunks on a table.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:05.10,0:49:07.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你甚至不是个尸体{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're not even a corpse.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:09.64,0:49:10.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:13.48,0:49:14.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,回答{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Respond.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:15.95,0:49:19.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是亚历克斯·墨菲探员{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am Officer Alex Murphy...
Dialogue: 0,0:49:19.69,0:49:21.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,底特律警察部{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...Detroit Police Department.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:21.45,0:49:22.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That won't do.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:30.06,0:49:31.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:34.23,0:49:38.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,机械警察 防止罪案组{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Robocop. Crime Prevention Unit.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:38.50,0:49:39.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,OCP{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}OCP.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:40.47,0:49:42.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好多了 ...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Better. Much better.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:46.65,0:49:47.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我输入什么 你就想什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I type it. You think it.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:48.82,0:49:51.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你输入什么我就想什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You type it. I think it.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:52.09,0:49:54.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你代表着一个大好机会{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What a wonderful opportunity you represent.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:55.49,0:49:57.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,心理治疗 是这么的...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Psychotherapy, it's such a...
Dialogue: 0,0:49:58.76,0:50:03.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,原本是缓慢 笨拙的过程 但用在你身上就简单得很{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a slow, clumsy practice. But with you this is so simple.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:03.43,0:50:05.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,直接{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Direct.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:12.41,0:50:13.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你很幸运{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're lucky.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:13.87,0:50:17.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你可在短时间内完成人类病人几年的疗程{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We can do in moments with you what would take years with a human patient.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:18.91,0:50:21.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我真的很幸运{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm really very lucky.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:21.38,0:50:25.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不用怀疑 也不用作痛苦的抉择{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're free. You're free from doubt. Free from having to make painful choices.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:27.85,0:50:29.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我很自由{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am free.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:30.52,0:50:32.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他准备好了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:33.56,0:50:35.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,输入指令程式{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Uploading command program.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:38.87,0:50:42.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我很高兴我们有这个机会对话{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am so glad we had this chance to dialogue.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:53.58,0:50:56.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你看起来像全新一样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look at you. It's like you're brand-new.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:56.32,0:50:57.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,过奖{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:57.85,0:50:59.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们很担心你呢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You really had us worried there, Murphy.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:00.09,0:51:01.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我很感动{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm touched.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:01.62,0:51:03.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看这个家伙{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get this guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:04.12,0:51:05.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他很感动{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's touched.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:06.56,0:51:10.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,够了 大家回岗位 快点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's enough. All of you, back to your posts. Come on. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:14.33,0:51:15.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,墨菲 你怎样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How you feeling, Murphy?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:15.97,0:51:19.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我很好 谢谢关心{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm just fine, Warren. Thank you for asking.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:20.31,0:51:21.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们带你到楼下去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's get you downstairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:22.08,0:51:25.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要看看OCP那班外行弄得怎样一团糟{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want to see what those amateurs at OCP screwed up.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:25.71,0:51:29.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可惜 这是个可爱的早上{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pity. It's a beautiful morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:29.68,0:51:31.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,浪费它真可惜{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shame to waste it.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:33.29,0:51:35.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 拍档 准备出勤了吗  - 当然{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Ready for duty, partner?  - You betcha.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:35.66,0:51:38.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我们走吧  - 我很渴望呢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Let's go.  - Nothing I'd rather do.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:40.29,0:51:41.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他听来很好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He sounds terrific.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:42.13,0:51:43.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有问题{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Something's wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:11.19,0:52:12.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大力一点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Harder!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:25.04,0:52:27.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,机械警察来了 大家快从后门走{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's Robo! Everybody out the back door!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:30.41,0:52:32.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 它锁上了  - 打不开{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It's locked!  - It won't open!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:37.18,0:52:39.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,墨菲 醒一醒{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Murph, wake up, will you?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:47.26,0:52:49.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,早安{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:54.17,0:52:56.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来吧 对付他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, take him out.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:01.37,0:53:03.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们应该谈一下{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think we should talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:07.18,0:53:09.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你有什么问题{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's with you, Murph?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:16.79,0:53:19.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 他们去了哪里 - "他们去了哪里"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Where'd they go?  - "Where'd they go?"
Dialogue: 0,0:53:19.83,0:53:23.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那些小混蛋还在这里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're still here, the little bastards!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:24.00,0:53:26.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,举手 来吧 大家站起来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hands up! Let's go! Everybody up!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:28.13,0:53:29.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快点 靠着墙壁{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Move it. Up against the wall.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:30.80,0:53:32.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:40.55,0:53:43.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,双手放在头上 不准动{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hands on top of your heads. Nobody move.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:43.88,0:53:46.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你被拘捕了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You are under arrest.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:46.35,0:53:48.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你有权保持缄默{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have the right to remain silent.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:48.79,0:53:52.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但你所说的一切会在法庭...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Anything you say can and will be used against you...
Dialogue: 0,0:53:52.49,0:53:55.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 成为呈堂证供  - 墨菲 他死了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- ...in a court of law.  - He's dead, Murphy.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:55.43,0:53:58.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你有权...  - 你在向死尸背诵拘捕法则{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You have the right...  - You're reading Miranda to a corpse!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:03.94,0:54:06.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我有麻烦{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm having trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:16.35,0:54:17.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, my.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:19.15,0:54:21.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样不太好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This isn't very nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:22.66,0:54:25.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,虽然你们可能觉得很有趣{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Though you may think you're having fun now...
Dialogue: 0,0:54:25.96,0:54:29.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但你们只会令爱你们的人伤心{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...you only hurt the one you love.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:30.43,0:54:32.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,想想爸妈{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Think of Mom and Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:32.73,0:54:35.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在教他们什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What kind of lesson are you teaching them?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:35.40,0:54:38.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在谈一下营养吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And now, a word on nutrition.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:38.70,0:54:40.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他妈的 他搞砸了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shit! He's fucked up!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:41.27,0:54:44.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,粗言秽语有损感情{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bad language makes for bad feelings.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:44.68,0:54:45.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们走吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:46.28,0:54:47.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,问题是...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The point is...
Dialogue: 0,0:54:48.05,0:54:50.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们都要工作{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...we all have to work.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:51.05,0:54:52.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我还没说完{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I haven't finished.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:54.39,0:54:56.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,墨菲 开快点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hit the gas, Murphy.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:56.82,0:54:59.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,车速限制是35{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The posted limit is 35.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:59.89,0:55:02.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们该作榜样的 安妮{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We should set an example, Anne.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:05.16,0:55:07.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的发型很好看{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your hair looks lovely that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:08.27,0:55:10.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是OCP 他们给你做了手脚{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's OCP. They did something to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:11.34,0:55:12.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我很好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:17.01,0:55:19.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今晚的月色不错吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Isn't the moon wonderful tonight?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:19.98,0:55:21.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在还是白天{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's still daytime.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:22.21,0:55:24.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,心意才是最重要的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's the thought that counts.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:24.35,0:55:28.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天啊 我们要回警察局 就这样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, Jesus, we're heading back to the station. That's all there is to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:44.00,0:55:45.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们干什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the hell are you doing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:45.74,0:55:47.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一寸光阴...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Waste makes haste...
Dialogue: 0,0:55:48.01,0:55:50.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一寸金{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...for time is fleeting.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:51.44,0:55:55.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,寸金难买寸光阴{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A rolling stone is worth two in the bush.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:55.28,0:55:57.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去搞个雪柜吧 蠢才{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go fuck a refrigerator, pecker neck!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:00.62,0:56:03.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,粗言秽语有损感情的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bad language makes for bad feelings.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:03.62,0:56:04.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是个傻瓜{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're nuts!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:09.46,0:56:11.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,墨菲 我们走吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Murphy, come on, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:13.23,0:56:14.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,走吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:15.98,0:56:18.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,（踢我）{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:21.77,0:56:23.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,退后{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Back!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:31.25,0:56:33.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢你不吸烟{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you for not smoking.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:43.70,0:56:46.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对了 是OCP{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, there it is. It's OCP.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:46.90,0:56:48.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们把他弄坏了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They screwed him up.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:48.90,0:56:51.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他一定是疯了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He must be going out of his mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:51.37,0:56:53.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他不能就这样说不的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's not as if he can just say no.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:53.91,0:56:58.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们把一些废话输入他的脑袋 他要服从{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They put all this nonsense into his brain. He has to obey.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:59.11,0:57:01.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把它们全部洗掉吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take them out, all of them!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:01.21,0:57:03.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,靠这副仪器做不来的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can't be done, not with this equipment.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:03.95,0:57:07.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你说没有办法 我不能相信{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you saying there's no way? I can't believe that.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:07.25,0:57:10.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当然有办法 你可以截断他头颅的线路{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sure, there are ways. You can pull his cranial circuits.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:10.62,0:57:12.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那会关掉他的生命维持器{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Which would shut down his life-support.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:13.13,0:57:16.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你可以用几千伏特电流通过他全身{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You could run a few thousand volts through him.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:16.83,0:57:18.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可能会把他杀死{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Probably kill him.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:10.86,0:58:12.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我去找人来帮忙{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll get some help!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:24.17,0:58:26.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 扶他进去  - 快点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Get him inside!  - Come on, move it!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:26.21,0:58:28.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 快点  - 别碰他 他很热的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Come on!  - Don't touch him, he's hot!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:28.51,0:58:30.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,用你们的外衣{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Use your jackets.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:30.25,0:58:31.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,干嘛他要那样做{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why'd he do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:31.68,0:58:34.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他烧毁自己来解除OCP的指令{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fried himself to get rid of OCP's crazy commands.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:34.75,0:58:37.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 慢慢来  - 他很重{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Nice and easy.  - He weighs a ton.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:44.73,0:58:46.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让开 走开{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Out of the way! Move out!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:51.50,0:58:54.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 他还活着吗  - 他很热{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Think he's alive?  - I don't know. He's pretty hot.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:54.34,0:58:55.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放下我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Put me down.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:56.31,0:58:57.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(列出指令)
Dialogue: 0,0:58:57.33,0:59:00.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(搜寻中...)
Dialogue: 0,0:59:00.61,0:59:02.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,扶他站起来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right. Come on, stand him up.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:02.77,0:59:05.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(没有指令)
Dialogue: 0,0:59:16.86,0:59:18.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们是不是警察{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are we cops?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:19.06,0:59:20.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在烦什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's bugging you, Murph?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:21.00,0:59:22.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,勒恩{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cain.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:23.47,0:59:24.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我在烦勒恩{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cain's bugging me.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:25.37,0:59:28.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,手足们 这只是开始{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have only just begun, my flock.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:28.77,0:59:31.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们不久便会在各个城市扩张{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Soon we will expand from city to city.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:31.71,0:59:34.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,富人和穷人生命里的每一刻...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The rich and poor alike will know a paradise...
Dialogue: 0,0:59:34.34,0:59:37.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都会置身天堂{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...for every moment of their lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:37.91,0:59:40.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是每种情绪的核灵{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is a Nuke for every mood.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:40.92,0:59:42.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们会提供给他们...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We'll offer the opportunity...
Dialogue: 0,0:59:42.68,0:59:46.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,控制各种情绪的机会{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...to control every aspect of their emotional lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:46.52,0:59:48.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里有白色声浪和黑色雷暴...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here with the white noise and black thunder...
Dialogue: 0,0:59:49.19,0:59:52.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还有红色输弹机和蓝色丝绒{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...and the red ramrod and the blue velvet.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:52.86,0:59:55.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,法兰克 蓝色丝绒{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Frank. The blue velvet.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:55.80,0:59:57.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它准备好了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think it's ready, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:02.74,1:00:04.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you, Frank.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:15.55,1:00:20.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那苯甲胺令我牙关扭动{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Frank. The Benzedrine's got my teeth wiggling.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:20.89,1:00:22.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,用莨菪碱代替它{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cut it with scopolamine.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:23.49,1:00:25.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 每支五毫升  - 知道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Five mils per.  - Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:28.46,1:00:30.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,美国制造{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Made in America.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:30.57,1:00:33.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那又再有意义了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. We're gonna make that mean something again.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:38.57,1:00:40.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 有警察  - 什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hey! Cops!  - What?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:40.38,1:00:41.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,警察{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cops!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:42.24,1:00:45.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们没有挂罢工牌的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And they ain't carrying no picket signs!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:46.11,1:00:48.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们去捉人呢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're going to kick somebody's ass!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:07.63,1:02:10.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把你的手给我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Give me your hand, goddamn it!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:29.54,1:03:31.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Christ!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:36.12,1:03:37.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他妈的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fuck!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:38.45,1:03:40.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快走{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get out!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:40.52,1:03:42.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有炸弹 伏下{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bomb! Get down!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:27.47,1:04:29.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,混蛋{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You son of a bitch!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:24.39,1:06:27.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,警方搜出贩卖核灵 所得的五亿元赃款{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Five hundred million in cash. Nuke money seized by police.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:28.16,1:06:32.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但州检察官不准破产的市政府碰它{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But State Attorney Sphincter won't let the bankrupt city government touch it.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:32.56,1:06:36.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,下一节报导警员工会作出威胁警察恢复执勤...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Coming up next, threats from the police union and cheers from the public...
Dialogue: 0,1:06:36.73,1:06:41.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,和拘捕核灵毒枭勒恩令市民欢呼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...as Metro-North cops go back to work and apprehend the Nuke lord, Cain...
Dialogue: 0,1:06:41.34,1:06:43.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,勒恩可能活不到受审{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...who may not live to stand trial.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:43.98,1:06:46.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,（加州 比华利山）{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:47.58,1:06:51.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,人们说自从失去了臭氧层 ...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They say 20 seconds in the California sunshine...
Dialogue: 0,1:06:51.91,1:06:54.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在在加州晒20秒太阳{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...is too much these days...
Dialogue: 0,1:06:54.85,1:06:57.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,已经太久了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...ever since we lost the ozone layer.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:57.45,1:07:02.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但那是在抗晒5000面世之前{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But that was before Sunblock 5000.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:02.89,1:07:05.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只要你在身上...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just apply a pint...
Dialogue: 0,1:07:06.09,1:07:07.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,涂一品脱{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...to your body...
Dialogue: 0,1:07:08.40,1:07:11.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,便能持续数小时{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...and you're good for hours.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:12.90,1:07:14.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在游泳池边见吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}See you by the pool.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:21.88,1:07:24.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抗晒5000{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sunblock 5000.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:24.71,1:07:28.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,新纪元的保障{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Protection for the new age.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:28.78,1:07:30.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,实验人选是暴力反社会分子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Subject is violently antisocial...
Dialogue: 0,1:07:30.99,1:07:34.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,自诩为神{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...given to delusions of godhood.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:34.89,1:07:38.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他有极深的毒瘾{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And he's hopelessly addicted to narcotics.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:39.56,1:07:42.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这会提供一个简单而可靠的方法...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Which offers us a simple and infallible method...
Dialogue: 0,1:07:42.26,1:07:45.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去保证他的服从性{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...of insuring his obedience.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:52.87,1:07:54.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是完美的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're perfect.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:55.78,1:07:57.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我一定要得到你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I must have you.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:01.38,1:08:04.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你说什么 你好像全不在乎{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you talking about? It's like you don't even care!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:04.59,1:08:07.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 照我的话做  - 他要我们对付他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Just do what I say, Angie!  - He'd want us to come for him!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:07.72,1:08:11.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,算了 不会发生的 我不想跟你争吵{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Forget about it! It's not gonna happen! I'm through arguing with you!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:11.49,1:08:15.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不是要求批准 他在医院 我们要救他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not asking permission! Cain is in the hospital, and we're getting him.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:16.03,1:08:19.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你也考虑过这件事 那些警察又如何{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You've really thought this out, haven't you? What about the cops?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:19.83,1:08:23.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们有枪 勒恩需要我们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We've got guns! Damn it, Hob, Cain needs us!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:23.04,1:08:24.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去他的勒恩{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fuck Cain!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:26.14,1:08:29.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你那样说他会杀死你的  - 他谁也不会杀{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- He'd kill you if he heard you.  - He's not gonna kill anybody!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:29.41,1:08:32.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 可能他已经死了  - 闭嘴{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Shit, he's probably dead already.  - You just shut the hell up!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:32.71,1:08:36.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,婊子 再吵就不给你核灵{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You mouth off like that again, and it's no more Nuke for you, bitch.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:38.72,1:08:41.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,该死 那是不公平的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Damn it, Hob, you know that's not fair.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:41.62,1:08:42.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别这样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:43.33,1:08:46.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我很难过  - 对 你很伤心{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It's been a bad time.  - Sure has. You're really hurting.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:47.23,1:08:48.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, so I'm hurting.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:48.86,1:08:51.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你很快会克服的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're gonna get the shakes soon, Angie.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:52.10,1:08:53.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很快克服{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You got it bad.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:55.60,1:08:57.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你这个混蛋{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You little bastard.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:00.61,1:09:03.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,以后你依我的说话做{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You just do what I tell you from now on, Angie.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:04.88,1:09:07.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,开车吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Start the motor and drive.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:10.55,1:09:12.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他会杀你的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He'll kill you.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:12.69,1:09:14.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他会杀我们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He'll kill us both.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:15.16,1:09:16.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去他的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fuck him.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:31.64,1:09:34.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你糟透了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, you're a mess.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:36.88,1:09:38.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我有好消息{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got good news for you.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:38.95,1:09:42.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你有一个永生的机会{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're going to have a chance for immortality.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:42.65,1:09:46.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只要那个可爱的脑袋没有受损{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As long as nothing happens to that lovely brain.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:55.63,1:09:58.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,韦文医生 我是茱莉·费{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dr. Weltman? It's Faxx.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:58.70,1:10:00.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们的病人死了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm afraid we lost our patient.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:01.24,1:10:03.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是 他刚死了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, he just expired.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:03.67,1:10:08.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,叫器官切除组来 在脑袋失效前我们有六分钟{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Contact the organ harvest team. We've got six minutes before the brain's useless.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:20.02,1:10:21.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,晚安{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Night.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:33.80,1:10:37.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快点动手 我们只有五分钟{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on. Let's move it. We've only got five minutes.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:38.37,1:10:39.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,锁上它{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lock it up.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:45.91,1:10:48.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把荧幕移近一点 我看不到它{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Move the screen in closer. I can't read it.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:50.22,1:10:54.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 怎样找到这个的  - 费找到他的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- How'd we get this one?  - Well, Faxx found him.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:55.06,1:10:56.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他自愿的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He volunteered.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:57.19,1:10:58.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,自愿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Volunteered?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:59.13,1:11:00.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好心的家伙{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Big-hearted guy.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:01.00,1:11:03.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对 但我们不是要他的心脏{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, it's not the heart we're after, though.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:05.87,1:11:09.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,说起心脏 艾莲怎样了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Speaking of hearts, how's Ilene?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:09.44,1:11:11.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天啊 大家都知道吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Christ, does everybody know?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:36.06,1:11:38.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了 屏气凝神{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, hold your breath.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:40.97,1:11:42.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,出场了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Showtime.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:44.07,1:11:46.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里完整干净 没有受伤{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's nice and clean in here. There's no damage.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:49.68,1:11:51.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here we go.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:51.65,1:11:52.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,慢慢来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Easy.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:54.68,1:11:57.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,行了 来了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We got it. Here it comes.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:57.85,1:12:00.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 好东西  - 很好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Thing of beauty.  - Excellent.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:00.52,1:12:03.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不知道你们怎样 但我很饿了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know about the rest of you, but I'm hungry.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:02.52,1:13:05.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,（底特律: 协助拯救汽车之城）{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:21.37,1:13:22.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:22.77,1:13:24.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:24.24,1:13:25.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,蜘蛛宝贝施莱基{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Spider Baby Stalirski!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:26.01,1:13:29.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他为底特律出力 现在你们为他出力{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's come out for Detroit, and now you come out for him.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:29.71,1:13:32.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,多条电话线等着接听你们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The lines are open, waiting for your pledge.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:33.11,1:13:35.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,若你想要一个诚实的政府...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you want an honest government...
Dialogue: 0,1:13:35.25,1:13:36.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为你做事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...that works for you...
Dialogue: 0,1:13:38.02,1:13:42.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我请求你慷慨解囊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...I'm asking you to dig deep into your pockets.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:42.56,1:13:45.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我请求你...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm asking you to give...
Dialogue: 0,1:13:46.19,1:13:48.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,随缘乐捐{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...whatever you can spare!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:48.70,1:13:50.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,数目有多少了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where does that put us?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:50.47,1:13:53.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,（我们的目标是37,480,911 收款是4,823）{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:55.67,1:13:57.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你好 是 小姐{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hi. Yes, ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:57.41,1:13:59.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你好 我是古泽市长{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hello! This is Mayor Kuzak!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:59.54,1:14:02.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,麻烦你调低电视机的声浪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Could you turn down your set, please?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:06.41,1:14:08.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,市长{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your Honor...
Dialogue: 0,1:14:08.62,1:14:11.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我有好消息给你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...I have some very good news for you.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:12.22,1:14:13.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我相信...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think...
Dialogue: 0,1:14:13.92,1:14:16.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,本市得救了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...the city is saved.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:17.23,1:14:19.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now...
Dialogue: 0,1:14:19.33,1:14:22.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你小心听着{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...you listen very carefully.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:23.00,1:14:25.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是吹牛的 有人会紧急援助本市{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's no bluff. Someone's shown up to bail the city out.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:26.17,1:14:29.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 一间对手的公司  - 市长没有说{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- A rival corporation.  - The mayor isn't saying.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:29.27,1:14:32.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们要绝对让他们的身分保密{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And whoever it is is taking great pains to keep their identity secret.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:33.11,1:14:36.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们会付现金 而不是经银行汇款{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're paying in cash and they're not moving the money through the banks.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:37.11,1:14:39.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢你 委员{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you, councilman.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:41.22,1:14:42.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就这样吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That will be all.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:43.42,1:14:45.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当你们接管...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, once you guys take over...
Dialogue: 0,1:14:45.85,1:14:49.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们给OCP的服务会得到报酬的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your services to OCP will be rewarded.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:53.39,1:14:56.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果市政府可以付钱 我们就很丢脸{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If the city can pay, we'll be humiliated.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:57.10,1:15:00.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,情况比那个更糟 我们调动八成的资源...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's worse than that. We've shifted 80 percent of our resources...
Dialogue: 0,1:15:00.80,1:15:03.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,用在那个市区的治安计划{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...to the urban pacification plan.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:03.20,1:15:08.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,若我们不能取消赎回权 对OCP的信心和股票都会下降{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If we can't foreclose, public confidence in OCP will plummet, so will our stock.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:08.31,1:15:09.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,老板{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sir?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:10.01,1:15:11.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我可否打岔{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If I may?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:11.51,1:15:13.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有另一个选择{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's another option.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:14.32,1:15:18.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们派监视装备跟踪市长{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We certainly have the surveillance capabilities to follow the mayor.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:18.75,1:15:21.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,视乎我们愿意做多少工夫{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It all depends how far we're willing to go.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:24.33,1:15:25.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果发生问题...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If anything went wrong...
Dialogue: 0,1:15:26.36,1:15:28.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,正如我所说...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As I said, sir...
Dialogue: 0,1:15:28.23,1:15:30.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,视乎我们愿意做多少工夫{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...it all depends how far we're willing to go.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:30.73,1:15:34.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们没有索偿权{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have no legal recourse.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:44.08,1:15:46.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不可以有目击证人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There must be no witnesses.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:46.31,1:15:48.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你太过分了 给我...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You've gone too far! Give me...
Dialogue: 0,1:15:49.22,1:15:50.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的血压{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your blood pressure.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:50.69,1:15:54.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,开除我好了 我的实验室里不可有非法毒品{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get me fired if you want to. You're not bringing illegal drugs to my lab!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:54.59,1:15:58.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不单只会开除你 别理会我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll do worse than get you fired. Now leave me alone!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:07.50,1:16:10.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,多么可怕的痛楚{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Such terrible pain.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:14.71,1:16:16.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不记得我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't remember me.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:18.05,1:16:20.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但你记得这个吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But you do remember this, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:26.72,1:16:29.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们有它 你要多少核灵都有{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And we have it. All the Nuke you'll ever need.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:36.56,1:16:38.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,慢一点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not so fast.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:38.70,1:16:41.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要你先替我做一件事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I need you to do something for me first.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:42.57,1:16:44.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然后痛楚就会停止{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then the pain stops.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:47.24,1:16:48.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,乖孩子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good boy.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:07.26,1:17:10.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不喜欢这样 我们还是走吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't like this. I think we'd better get out of here while we can.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:11.10,1:17:12.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道我在做什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know what I'm doing.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:43.53,1:17:46.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你有现钞的话 把它放进内裤吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you have any cash, put it in your shorts.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:46.37,1:17:48.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那真是无礼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's just plain rude.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:01.35,1:18:03.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你可否帮我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wonder if any of you could help me.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:03.58,1:18:05.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想找何博先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm looking for a Mr. Hob.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:05.79,1:18:07.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So...
Dialogue: 0,1:18:07.56,1:18:09.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要多少{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...how much you need?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:10.29,1:18:11.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是指钱{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Money, I mean.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:11.89,1:18:14.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们现在欠OCP...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, our current debt to OCP is...
Dialogue: 0,1:18:16.76,1:18:20.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,37,480,911元{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}$37,480,911 dollars.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:20.57,1:18:22.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你有大麻烦了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Guess you're in some pretty deep shit.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:23.00,1:18:25.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们需要大量的资助{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We need all the help we can get, young man.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:25.31,1:18:27.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,记下我给五十吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tell you what. Put me down for 50, just to make sure.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:28.68,1:18:32.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 五角 五十元 真可爱  - 别做傻瓜{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- 50 cents, 50 dollars. That's cute.  - Don't be a queer.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:33.21,1:18:34.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是五千万{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fifty million.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:34.72,1:18:37.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,胡说八道 我们走吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is bullshit. Let's get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:46.10,1:18:49.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,（危险 拆炸弹小组）{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:02.51,1:19:04.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good God.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:11.05,1:19:12.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,各位{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gentlemen?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:12.95,1:19:14.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,五千万够吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, will 50 do it?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:17.09,1:19:20.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,够 可以了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, yes. That'll do it.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:20.36,1:19:22.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你认为够吗  - 够了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Don't you guys think that'll do it?  - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:22.96,1:19:25.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,五千万 够了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fifty mil. That will do it.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:26.17,1:19:28.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 够了  - 这些人是罪犯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- That'll do it.  - These people are criminals!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:29.14,1:19:31.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为何你给人家定标签 我讨厌标签{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why do you have to label people? I hate labels!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:31.92,1:19:32.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,闭嘴{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You shut up.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:59.69,1:20:02.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在灭罪的斗争中我们不能屈从{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We cannot capitulate in the war on crime.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:02.79,1:20:06.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我会丢掉官职的 我相信没有人想那样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'd be voted out of office. I don't think anyone wants that.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:06.39,1:20:08.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们不反对灭罪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}War on crime is fine with us.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:08.93,1:20:11.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们说的是生意{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's business we're talking about here.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:11.46,1:20:13.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你可知道我们雇用多少人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you have any idea how many people we employ?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:14.00,1:20:17.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不知道 我从没有想过{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. I never thought about it like that.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:17.54,1:20:18.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,精明的孩子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sharp kid.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:19.04,1:20:20.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So...
Dialogue: 0,1:20:20.94,1:20:22.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,灭罪的斗争...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...your war on crime...
Dialogue: 0,1:20:22.68,1:20:24.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你想不想赢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...you want to win it or what?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:25.24,1:20:27.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们是你唯一的机会{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're the only chance you have.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:27.98,1:20:29.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听他说{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Listen to him.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:29.95,1:20:31.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他有全盘大计{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's got it all worked out.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:38.46,1:20:39.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么人们犯罪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why do people do crimes?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:41.23,1:20:44.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 为什么 人们吸毒  - 因为他们要毒品{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Why? Drugs. People do drugs.  - Because they want drugs.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:45.20,1:20:47.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要那种贵价货{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The kind that cost too much.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:48.23,1:20:51.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,核灵价廉物美{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nuke gives high quality at a cheap price.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:51.27,1:20:53.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果你不干涉我们 我们会卖得更便宜{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you get off our backs, we'll make it cheaper.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:53.77,1:20:54.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,和更安全{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And safer.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:54.97,1:20:57.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们没有强迫人家吸食我们的货{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We don't shove our shit down anybody's throat.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:57.54,1:21:01.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也没有像香烟洋酒般卖广告{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And we don't advertise it like they do with cigarettes or booze.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:01.31,1:21:03.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以别管我们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So leave us alone...
Dialogue: 0,1:21:03.35,1:21:06.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也别管要买它的人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...and anybody who wants it gets it.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:08.75,1:21:10.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那就再没有罪案了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So no more crimes.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:10.66,1:21:14.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你会是整顿底特律的市长{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You get to be the mayor who cleaned up Detroit.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:21.73,1:21:23.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他说得有理{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's got a point.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:24.74,1:21:26.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你认为是不是{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't you think he's got a point?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:26.61,1:21:28.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是 他有道理{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, he's got a point.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:34.11,1:21:35.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the hell is that?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:45.12,1:21:46.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快走{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get out!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:51.92,1:22:53.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,市长 你...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Marv, are...
Dialogue: 0,1:23:46.23,1:23:55.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(身分搜寻: 市长与目击者)
Dialogue: 0,1:23:55.08,1:23:58.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(记忆)
Dialogue: 0,1:24:33.76,1:24:35.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,勒恩{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cain.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:36.03,1:24:37.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,厉害{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, wow.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:41.30,1:24:43.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你看来很好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You look great.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:41.69,1:25:44.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要习惯一下...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It'll take some getting used to...
Dialogue: 0,1:25:46.97,1:25:49.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但这样会很好的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...but it'll be great, Cain.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:51.35,1:28:52.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,躺着别动{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lie still.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:58.09,1:29:01.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我很冻  - 你会休克{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I'm cold.  - You are going into shock.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:02.16,1:29:04.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我会找急救医疗队来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I will call for a medical emergency unit.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:05.10,1:29:07.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等一下 不{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait. No.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:09.20,1:29:10.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要丢下我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't leave me.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:13.77,1:29:15.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不会丢下你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I won't leave you.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:20.91,1:29:22.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是谁做的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who did this?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:22.88,1:29:24.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它很大呢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was big.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:25.28,1:29:27.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,比你还大{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bigger than you.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:28.15,1:29:29.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是勒恩{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was Cain.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:31.69,1:29:33.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我快要死了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm gonna die.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:36.09,1:29:38.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你知道那是怎样的吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know what that's like, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:39.76,1:29:42.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是难受{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It really sucks.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:48.57,1:29:50.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:10.96,1:30:15.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在一宗核灵赃款大屠杀里有13人死亡{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thirteen dead in what appears to be a Nuke money massacre.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:15.23,1:30:18.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,死者当中有两名市政府委员{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Among the victims, two city councilmen.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:18.50,1:30:21.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,市政府是否想勾结大毒枭{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Was the city trying to strike a deal with the drug lords?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:21.87,1:30:24.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,无可奉告 我说无可奉告{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No comment! I said, I have no comment!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:25.14,1:30:27.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我对这些指控无可奉告{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No comments on these allegations.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:27.28,1:30:30.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这些人孜孜不倦的服务本市{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}These were men who served this city tirelessly.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:30.48,1:30:34.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但我向底特律市民承诺{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}However, I make a promise to the people of Detroit City...
Dialogue: 0,1:30:34.89,1:30:38.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们会全力以赴彻底调查这件事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...that no effort will be spared to investigate this thoroughly!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:38.29,1:30:40.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是市长 那个...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But, Mr. Mayor, what about...
Dialogue: 0,1:30:40.29,1:30:42.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉 不要再问了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry. No more questions.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:42.99,1:30:45.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们的古泽市长{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Our own Mayor Kuzak.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:45.23,1:30:46.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在看杰西的现场报导{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now let's go live to Jess.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:47.10,1:30:52.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是OCP赠予本市 楼高一百层的市府大楼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And here it is, the Civic Centrum, OCP's 100-story gift to the Motor City.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:52.30,1:30:55.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,尽管OCP的敌意收购持续引起争议{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}While debate continues over OCP's hostile takeover...
Dialogue: 0,1:30:55.51,1:30:58.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里的气氛却很热闹{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...there's no denying the mood down here is festive.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:58.28,1:31:01.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,受访问的市民都表示兴奋{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Citizens interviewed on the scene expressed excitement and hope...
Dialogue: 0,1:31:01.98,1:31:06.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还希望OCP会兑现改善本市生活的承诺{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...that OCP will make good on its promise of a better life in Detroit.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:06.35,1:31:08.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 记者  - 抱歉 只限传媒{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Press!  - Sorry, folks, media only.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:08.55,1:31:10.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只限电视台和报馆你们要退后{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}TV and press only. You'll have to step back.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:19.53,1:31:20.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他来了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There he is!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:27.24,1:31:29.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,OCP能否重振底特律的工业{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can OCP bring industry back to Detroit?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:29.57,1:31:32.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,OCP是否拥有本市 你可会举行大选{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Does OCP own the city? Will you hold elections?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:32.34,1:31:35.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我们是否成为OCP的雇员  - 为何不去大会堂{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Do we become OCP employees?  - Why not go to City Hall?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:35.81,1:31:37.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等一会{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just a minute.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:37.85,1:31:39.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小姐 我会回答这问题{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll answer that, young lady.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:39.92,1:31:44.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大会堂是管理不善和腐败的象征{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}City Hall is the decaying symbol of mismanagement and corruption.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:44.69,1:31:45.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你拍到了吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You get that?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:46.09,1:31:50.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这座宏伟的建筑物是新领导的所在{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This magnificent structure will be the seat of leadership for the new Detroit.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:50.20,1:31:53.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可不是个廉洁新开始的好地方{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And what better place for a clean, fresh start?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:53.67,1:31:56.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,各位报界朋友...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And so, people of the press...
Dialogue: 0,1:31:56.90,1:31:58.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,市政府官员{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...city officials...
Dialogue: 0,1:31:58.80,1:32:02.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在一息间普及消费者产品...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...in a few minutes Omni Consumer Products...
Dialogue: 0,1:32:02.21,1:32:04.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,和动乱的底特律市...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...and the troubled city of Detroit...
Dialogue: 0,1:32:05.18,1:32:08.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,会携手共创新里程{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...will join in a bold new venture.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:09.18,1:32:11.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在我想解释一下...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now I'd like to explain...
Dialogue: 0,1:32:11.38,1:32:13.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这件事的意义{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...just what this will mean.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:13.45,1:32:16.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有时候我们要...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sometimes we just have to start over...
Dialogue: 0,1:32:16.32,1:32:17.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,从头开始...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...from scratch...
Dialogue: 0,1:32:17.86,1:32:19.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去修正事情{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...to make things right.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:20.16,1:32:23.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这正是我们要做的事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And that's exactly what we're going to do.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:23.83,1:32:26.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们会兴建一个全新的城市{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're going to build a brand-new city...
Dialogue: 0,1:32:26.50,1:32:28.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,座落在目前的底特律市{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...where Detroit now stands.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:28.97,1:32:30.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一个全世界...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}An example...
Dialogue: 0,1:32:31.10,1:32:32.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,的榜样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...to the world.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:53.69,1:32:54.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,各位朋友...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My friends...
Dialogue: 0,1:32:55.09,1:32:58.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,欢迎到来我们原来就该有的城市{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...welcome to our city as it should be.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:58.56,1:33:02.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它也会落在负责任的...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And as it will be, in the hands of responsible...
Dialogue: 0,1:33:02.60,1:33:04.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,私人企业的手上{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...private enterprise.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:05.97,1:33:07.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请欢迎...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And a special welcome...
Dialogue: 0,1:33:08.17,1:33:11.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,古泽市长和即将离任的官员{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...to Mayor Kuzak and the outgoing administration.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:11.71,1:33:13.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们不会离开的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're not going anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:14.31,1:33:15.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,市长{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your Honor.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:17.98,1:33:21.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们要拆毁很多房屋才兴建到那个的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You'll have to tear down a lot of houses to make that.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:21.29,1:33:23.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拆毁家园{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean, take away their homes!
Dialogue: 0,1:33:23.22,1:33:26.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们会兴建玻璃和钢铁的大厦{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're going to raise towers of glass and steel.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:26.46,1:33:30.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,每个市民都会有一间 安全 干净的居所{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Every citizen will have a living unit, safe, secure, and clean.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:30.43,1:33:31.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请你坐下{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, please take your seat.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:32.10,1:33:34.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有多少空间作邻舍设施{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Won't be much room for neighborhoods.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:34.43,1:33:36.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不像我们成长的环境{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not like the kind we all grew up in.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:36.80,1:33:39.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今天邻舍是罪恶的温床{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Today neighborhoods are places where bad things happen.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:39.97,1:33:41.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要怀旧了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't be nostalgic.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:41.41,1:33:44.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,民主呢 没有人选过你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What about democracy? Nobody elected you.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:44.68,1:33:47.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,任何人都可以购买OCP股票{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Anyone can buy OCP stock...
Dialogue: 0,1:33:47.25,1:33:49.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,和拥有本市的一部分{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...and own a piece of our city.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:50.78,1:33:53.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有什么比那个更民主{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What could be more democratic than that?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:53.22,1:33:57.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,本市有很多人都买不起你们的股票{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's a lot of people in this town that can't afford to buy your stock!
Dialogue: 0,1:33:57.89,1:34:00.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们也不会让你得逞的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And they won't let you get away with this.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:00.46,1:34:02.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你一直没有关注民意{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You haven't been following the polls.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:04.20,1:34:05.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,坐下{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sit down.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:07.00,1:34:09.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,市长 坐下吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sit down, mayor.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:13.40,1:34:16.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一年前我们给了本市机械警察{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}About a year ago we gave this city Robocop.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:16.21,1:34:18.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他的表现很好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think he's worked out pretty well.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:18.71,1:34:21.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但外面的治安越来越差{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But things have become rougher out there.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:21.21,1:34:24.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在我们需要一个执法者...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And now we need a law enforcement unit...
Dialogue: 0,1:34:24.35,1:34:26.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他可以亲身对付敌人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...able to meet the enemy on his own ground...
Dialogue: 0,1:34:26.82,1:34:29.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,携带足够的火力 ...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...and carrying enough firepower...
Dialogue: 0,1:34:29.82,1:34:32.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把任务完成{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...to get the job done.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:36.96,1:34:39.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,各位来宾...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ladies and gentlemen...
Dialogue: 0,1:34:39.23,1:34:40.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我很高兴...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...with great pleasure...
Dialogue: 0,1:34:41.30,1:34:42.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为大家介绍...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...I give you...
Dialogue: 0,1:34:43.00,1:34:45.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,机械警察二号{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...Robocop 2.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:54.21,1:34:57.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 那些混蛋都是狂人  - 什么事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Those bastards are maniacs!  - What's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,1:34:57.35,1:35:00.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不能相信 是他们 他们派它去的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't believe it. It was them! They sent it!
Dialogue: 0,1:35:00.45,1:35:01.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,派什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sent what?
Dialogue: 0,1:35:02.42,1:35:03.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:03.82,1:35:06.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个装置将会有大量需求{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There going to be a big call for this unit.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:06.42,1:35:08.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们也会在底特律制造他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And we'll make him right here in Detroit.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:08.79,1:35:11.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是我们可以引以为傲的工作{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That means jobs we can all be proud of.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:11.93,1:35:14.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而且令"美国制造" ...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And make "Made in America"...
Dialogue: 0,1:35:14.27,1:35:16.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再有着新意义{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...mean something again.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:19.60,1:35:21.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个容器...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This single container...
Dialogue: 0,1:35:21.87,1:35:25.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,盛着的核灵足以令一条街的人上瘾{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...holds enough Nuke to addict a city block.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:25.51,1:35:28.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,每天生产一百个{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A hundred of these are produced every day...
Dialogue: 0,1:35:28.45,1:35:29.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,和送到工厂去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...and sent to sweatshops...
Dialogue: 0,1:35:30.08,1:35:33.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,城市劳工就在那里制这个毒品...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...where urban slaves prepare this poison...
Dialogue: 0,1:35:33.22,1:35:36.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,供应我们的朋友 亲人 子女{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...for our friends, our loved ones, our children.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:36.45,1:35:37.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我认为...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, I say...
Dialogue: 0,1:35:38.19,1:35:41.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是时候制止这个瘟疫{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...it's high time we put an end to this plague.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:41.66,1:35:45.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,机械警察二号会搜查每间实验室{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Robocop 2 will seek out every laboratory...
Dialogue: 0,1:35:45.96,1:35:49.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,每个毒贩 并且铲除市内的核灵{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...every dealer, and rid our city of Nuke.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:53.40,1:35:54.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不错{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:54.91,1:35:58.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有这个家伙就会安宁多了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Things will be a lot quieter with this boy around.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:13.79,1:36:16.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 他有什么问题  - 没事的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What's wrong with him?  - It's nothing.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:16.29,1:36:18.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 完全没问题  - 关掉他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Nothing at all.  - Turn him off.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:19.90,1:36:21.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不可以{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:21.33,1:36:23.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,勒恩 我们到外面去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cain! Let's step outside.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:26.37,1:36:29.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你 快走 你是过时的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You! Get out of here! You're obsolete!
Dialogue: 0,1:36:29.57,1:36:31.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是个杀人凶手{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That thing is a killer!
Dialogue: 0,1:36:31.31,1:36:34.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 它没有携械 它没有杀伤力的  - 它是个凶手 我亲眼看到{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It's not even armed! It's harmless!  - It's a killer, and I saw it!
Dialogue: 0,1:36:50.93,1:36:53.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 带她走  - 放开我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Take her out of here! Now!  - Let me go!
Dialogue: 0,1:37:14.49,1:37:16.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们检点一下{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Behave yourselves!
Dialogue: 0,1:37:27.69,1:37:30.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(瞄准中)
Dialogue: 0,1:38:04.54,1:38:08.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 什么事  - 天晓得 里面听来像打仗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What's the deal here?  - Christ knows. Sounds like a war in there.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:21.97,1:38:24.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(瞄准)
Dialogue: 0,1:39:22.31,1:39:25.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要和我同归于尽{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're coming with me, Cain.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:24.00,1:41:25.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他在那儿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There he is!
Dialogue: 0,1:41:37.18,1:41:40.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 退后  - 你是否妒忌那个代替品{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- All right, get back!  - Are you jealous of the replacement?
Dialogue: 0,1:42:31.27,1:42:34.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样对OCP很不利{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This could look bad for OCP, Johnson.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:34.71,1:42:37.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,打乱我们最优秀的智囊团{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Scramble the best spin team we have.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:14.60,1:43:19.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(身份 记忆)
Dialogue: 0,1:43:14.60,1:43:19.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,1:43:47.18,1:43:49.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,子弹{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ammo! Ammo!
Dialogue: 0,1:44:09.80,1:44:11.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,下来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get down!
Dialogue: 0,1:44:33.06,1:44:34.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,停火{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hold your fire!
Dialogue: 0,1:44:34.89,1:44:37.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,停火{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hold your fire, damn it!
Dialogue: 0,1:44:59.68,1:45:01.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快搬他走{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's get him out of here.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:03.42,1:45:06.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小心他的头 他伤得很重{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Watch his neck. He's hurt bad. Easy.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:13.13,1:45:14.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,该死{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shit!
Dialogue: 0,1:45:16.10,1:45:17.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要回去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I gotta get back.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:17.30,1:45:19.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快回去...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Move it back! Move it back!
Dialogue: 0,1:45:34.55,1:45:36.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,给他要的东西吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's give him what he wants.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:41.91,1:45:43.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(瞄准)
Dialogue: 0,1:45:45.95,1:45:49.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(记忆)
Dialogue: 0,1:47:37.21,1:47:38.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再见{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:11.18,1:48:13.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是个麻烦 有这么多死伤者{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's serious trouble. So many dead and wounded.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:13.71,1:48:15.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,死者不会构成麻烦的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There won't be trouble from the dead.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:15.91,1:48:18.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们都有亲人的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They'll have relatives. They always do.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:18.28,1:48:21.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 会造成大量索赔的  - 只是钱罢了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It'll be a feeding frenzy.  - It's only money.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:21.45,1:48:23.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 刑事诉讼又如何  - 这个...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What about criminal proceedings?  - Well...
Dialogue: 0,1:48:23.69,1:48:27.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们正在研究主要的起诉 就是刑期{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...we're looking at major indictments, sir. Prison terms.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:27.69,1:48:30.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我又如何  - 我们会尽力而为的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What about me?  - You know we'll do whatever we can.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:30.53,1:48:32.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 那不够好  - 老板{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- That's not good enough.  - Sir?
Dialogue: 0,1:48:32.56,1:48:34.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果说这件事是个人的行为又如何{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What if this was the work of one individual?
Dialogue: 0,1:48:35.00,1:48:38.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一个跟我们公司的目标不一致的人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A person who had her own agenda, wasn't in sync with the goals of our company?
Dialogue: 0,1:48:39.14,1:48:41.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那通常是可行的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, that usually works.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:42.37,1:48:44.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一个不合作的女人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A woman who was not a team player.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:45.01,1:48:47.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她违反了我们的信任{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who violated our trust.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:48.81,1:48:51.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放松{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Easy, easy.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:51.55,1:48:53.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well...
Dialogue: 0,1:48:53.25,1:48:55.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们需要一些证据来支持{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...we'd need some evidence to support that.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:55.85,1:48:58.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不管证据是否存在 我也找得到的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sir, whether it exists or not, I know I can find it.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:58.82,1:49:01.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她的确挑选了那个脑袋{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She did choose the brain, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:03.33,1:49:05.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 好计谋  - 老板{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Good thinking.  - Sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:05.76,1:49:07.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢天谢地你平安无事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank God you're all right.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:08.10,1:49:11.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我很担心 我以为它会伤害你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was worried. I thought it was going to hurt you.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:11.60,1:49:13.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,事情结束了...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's over. It's all over.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:15.04,1:49:16.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我令你失望了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I failed you.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:16.74,1:49:20.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别怪责自己 不会有事的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't be hard on yourself. Everything's going to be all right.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:23.25,1:49:27.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,强生 我们谈的那件事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Johnson, that business we were talking about.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:27.52,1:49:29.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要马上着手进行{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get right on it.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:33.62,1:49:35.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,知道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:39.66,1:49:42.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看他们弄成这个样子 他们是罪犯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just look at what they've done. They are criminals.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:42.90,1:49:45.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我保证OCP不会拥有本市很久的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}OCP won't own this city for long. And I'll see to that.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:45.87,1:49:48.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我会和市民上街示威{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll take it to the streets and the people.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:48.44,1:49:49.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这件事有何教训{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What has it come to?
Dialogue: 0,1:49:50.01,1:49:52.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,商人可以像股票般收买我们的权利{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Businessmen can buy our rights like stock?
Dialogue: 0,1:49:52.88,1:49:54.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们不明白我们正在失去什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't realize what we're losing!
Dialogue: 0,1:49:56.81,1:49:59.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 先生 这里  - 发表一下{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Right here, sir!  - Give us a statement!
Dialogue: 0,1:49:59.22,1:50:02.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,数十人死了 这是否你心目中的改善生活{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dozens are dead. Is this your idea of a better life?
Dialogue: 0,1:50:03.12,1:50:06.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 这是不是一个实验  - 他疯的 这件事怎么发生的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Was this an experiment of some kind?  - He was crazy. How did it happen?
Dialogue: 0,1:50:07.16,1:50:11.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你们是否制造它来控制大局  - 你对这次灾难有何感想{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Did you build it to take control?  - How do you account for this disaster?
Dialogue: 0,1:50:11.26,1:50:14.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,OCP可会给受害者们赔偿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Will OCP make reparations to the victims?
Dialogue: 0,1:50:15.20,1:50:17.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那混蛋竟然可以脱身{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That son of a bitch is getting away with it.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:17.84,1:50:19.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们碰不了他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We can't even touch him.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:21.21,1:50:22.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,忍耐一点吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Patience, Lewis.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:24.54,1:50:26.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们都不过是人罢了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're only human.
